{"4579110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Courier Beware", "steam_appid": 4579110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Connect Beyond</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself installing a strange program you found on the Internet. Upon running it a mysterious robed man greets you: will you connect? What lies on the other side is a young twenty something named Leena who can see the dead. Something is causing an influx of restless spirits in her city, and she needs your help to get to the bottom of it while still finding time to pay the rent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579110/extras/6b333dcbcf8cecf02df817778990b667.poster.avif?t=1788301828\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579110/extras/6b333dcbcf8cecf02df817778990b667.webm?t=1788301828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579110/extras/6b333dcbcf8cecf02df817778990b667.mp4?t=1788301828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gig Work From Hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leena pays the bills with food delivery. Unfortunately, it feels like half the city is haunted. You'll have to strike a balance between going through with risky jobs or taking huge rating hits from unsatisfied customers. What's worse: losing your mind or your apartment?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Time Comes For You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solving mysteries requires a mix of careful observation and training the right stats. Can't recognize an artifact for what it is without enough knowledge, nor ply the right tongue without enough charisma. But everything takes time so you may have to decide which mysteries stay unsolved, or strike a bargain with the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579110/extras/305ff3686cd61405abb8cd1745d805b7.poster.avif?t=1788301828\" width=526 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579110/extras/305ff3686cd61405abb8cd1745d805b7.webm?t=1788301828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579110/extras/305ff3686cd61405abb8cd1745d805b7.mp4?t=1788301828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Connect Beyond</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You find yourself installing a strange program you found on the Internet. Upon running it a mysterious robed man greets you: will you connect? What lies on the other side is a young twenty something named Leena who can see the dead. Something is causing an influx of restless spirits in her city, and she needs your help to get to the bottom of it while still finding time to pay the rent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579110/extras/6b333dcbcf8cecf02df817778990b667.poster.avif?t=1788301828\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579110/extras/6b333dcbcf8cecf02df817778990b667.webm?t=1788301828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4579110/extras/6b333dcbcf8cecf02df817778990b667.mp4?t=1788301828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_t